{"id":"forecast-01","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-01/audio-3.mp3","model":"small","duration":345.62,"segments":[{"start":16.69,"end":20.93,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 24.","words":[["Now",16.69,17.09],["listen",17.09,17.47],["carefully",17.47,18.03],["and",18.03,18.37],["answer",18.37,18.71],["questions",18.71,19.39],["21",19.39,20.03],["to",20.03,20.37],["24.",20.37,20.93]]},{"start":24.62,"end":25.94,"text":"Hi, come on in.","words":[["Hi,",24.62,25.08],["come",25.42,25.58],["on",25.58,25.74],["in.",25.74,25.94]]},{"start":26.64,"end":26.96,"text":"Thanks.","words":[["Thanks.",26.64,26.96]]},{"start":27.38,"end":29.68,"text":"Thanks for agreeing to see us, Dr Harrison.","words":[["Thanks",27.38,27.8],["for",27.8,28.06],["agreeing",28.06,28.32],["to",28.32,28.56],["see",28.56,28.82],["us,",28.82,29.02],["Dr",29.08,29.24],["Harrison.",29.24,29.68]]},{"start":30.36,"end":35.36,"text":"We wanted to talk over our work on the Managing Visitor Attractions module.","words":[["We",30.36,30.6],["wanted",30.6,30.96],["to",30.96,31.18],["talk",31.18,31.44],["over",31.44,31.76],["our",31.76,32.02],["work",32.02,32.46],["on",32.46,32.84],["the",32.84,33.08],["Managing",33.08,33.54],["Visitor",33.54,34.22],["Attractions",34.22,34.98],["module.",34.98,35.36]]},{"start":36.02,"end":40.26,"text":"Right. You've been on placement at Davenport Zoo, haven't you?","words":[["Right.",36.02,36.48],["You've",37.04,37.48],["been",37.48,37.76],["on",37.76,37.98],["placement",37.98,38.4],["at",38.4,38.74],["Davenport",38.74,39.28],["Zoo,",39.28,39.66],["haven't",39.84,40.1],["you?",40.1,40.26]]},{"start":40.48,"end":40.82,"text":"Yeah.","words":[["Yeah.",40.48,40.82]]},{"start":41.48,"end":43.6,"text":"So, what did you want to ask me about?","words":[["So,",41.48,41.96],["what",42.12,42.34],["did",42.34,42.48],["you",42.48,42.62],["want",42.62,42.74],["to",42.74,42.84],["ask",42.84,43.1],["me",43.1,43.32],["about?",43.32,43.6]]},{"start":43.6,"end":43.74,"text":"What?","words":[["What?",43.6,43.74]]},{"start":44.38,"end":49.34,"text":"Basically, we're very positive about what we've seen at the zoo as a tourist attraction,","words":[["Basically,",44.38,45.0],["we're",45.42,45.58],["very",45.58,45.8],["positive",45.8,46.36],["about",46.36,46.82],["what",46.82,47.08],["we've",47.08,47.3],["seen",47.3,47.56],["at",47.56,47.7],["the",47.7,47.8],["zoo",47.8,48.04],["as",48.04,48.36],["a",48.36,48.52],["tourist",48.52,48.78],["attraction,",48.78,49.34]]},{"start":50.07,"end":52.24,"text":"but there are things we're more critical about.","words":[["but",50.07,50.38],["there",50.38,50.58],["are",50.58,50.68],["things",50.68,50.96],["we're",50.96,51.26],["more",51.26,51.42],["critical",51.42,51.8],["about.",51.8,52.24]]},{"start":52.88,"end":53.82,"text":"What precisely?","words":[["What",52.88,53.3],["precisely?",53.3,53.82]]},{"start":54.66,"end":61.02,"text":"Well, the numbers visiting the zoo are rising rapidly and the quality of the visitor experience","words":[["Well,",54.66,54.94],["the",55.32,55.44],["numbers",55.44,55.86],["visiting",55.86,56.36],["the",56.36,56.66],["zoo",56.66,56.94],["are",56.94,57.24],["rising",57.24,57.68],["rapidly",57.68,58.2],["and",58.2,59.0],["the",59.0,59.18],["quality",59.18,59.52],["of",59.52,59.84],["the",59.84,59.96],["visitor",59.96,60.28],["experience",60.28,61.02]]},{"start":61.02,"end":63.18,"text":"is good for young and old.","words":[["is",61.02,61.34],["good",61.34,61.66],["for",61.66,62.32],["young",62.32,62.58],["and",62.58,62.8],["old.",62.8,63.18]]},{"start":63.58,"end":66.32,"text":"Yes, and we'll certainly emphasise that.","words":[["Yes,",63.58,63.86],["and",64.36,64.74],["we'll",64.74,65.02],["certainly",65.02,65.42],["emphasise",65.42,66.04],["that.",66.04,66.32]]},{"start":67.26,"end":70.5,"text":"But from a business point of view, we saw some problems.","words":[["But",67.26,67.6],["from",67.6,67.8],["a",67.8,67.96],["business",67.96,68.24],["point",68.24,68.58],["of",68.58,68.78],["view,",68.78,69.06],["we",69.48,69.66],["saw",69.66,69.88],["some",69.88,70.06],["problems.",70.06,70.5]]},{"start":70.5,"end":73.98,"text":"They don't seem to employ their workers fully enough.","words":[["They",70.5,71.72],["don't",71.72,71.96],["seem",71.96,72.14],["to",72.14,72.3],["employ",72.3,72.68],["their",72.68,72.9],["workers",72.9,73.28],["fully",73.28,73.62],["enough.",73.62,73.98]]},{"start":74.76,"end":76.84,"text":"There really seem to be too many of them.","words":[["There",74.76,74.94],["really",74.94,75.22],["seem",75.22,75.5],["to",75.5,75.66],["be",75.66,75.82],["too",75.82,76.08],["many",76.08,76.38],["of",76.38,76.62],["them.",76.62,76.84]]},{"start":77.3,"end":79.82,"text":"Which means they're wasting money on wages.","words":[["Which",77.3,77.7],["means",77.7,78.06],["they're",78.06,78.46],["wasting",78.46,78.76],["money",78.76,79.18],["on",79.18,79.4],["wages.",79.4,79.82]]},{"start":80.48,"end":81.44,"text":"They should streamline.","words":[["They",80.48,80.68],["should",80.68,80.88],["streamline.",80.88,81.44]]},{"start":82.0,"end":85.68,"text":"Yeah. And they could do more to get larger visitor groups.","words":[["Yeah.",82.0,82.26],["And",82.86,83.2],["they",83.2,83.46],["could",83.46,83.6],["do",83.6,83.82],["more",83.82,84.08],["to",84.08,84.26],["get",84.26,84.42],["larger",84.42,84.86],["visitor",84.86,85.18],["groups.",85.18,85.68]]},{"start":86.22,"end":87.52,"text":"School groups, for example.","words":[["School",86.22,86.58],["groups,",86.58,86.94],["for",87.08,87.14],["example.",87.14,87.52]]},{"start":88.12,"end":91.28,"text":"They put on great educational activities for kids.","words":[["They",88.12,88.3],["put",88.3,88.48],["on",88.48,88.72],["great",88.72,89.16],["educational",89.16,89.92],["activities",89.92,90.6],["for",90.6,90.9],["kids.",90.9,91.28]]},{"start":91.78,"end":94.34,"text":"But there isn't much take-up by schools.","words":[["But",91.78,92.22],["there",92.22,92.6],["isn't",92.6,92.96],["much",92.96,93.18],["take",93.18,93.48],["-up",93.48,93.72],["by",93.72,93.94],["schools.",93.94,94.34]]},{"start":95.24,"end":98.44,"text":"Probably because their advertising isn't targeted enough.","words":[["Probably",95.24,95.68],["because",95.68,96.2],["their",96.2,96.5],["advertising",96.5,97.08],["isn't",97.08,97.64],["targeted",97.64,98.02],["enough.",98.02,98.44]]},{"start":98.44,"end":104.16,"text":"Well, those are valid observations, but you should word them in such a way that they won't","words":[["Well,",98.44,99.24],["those",99.4,99.58],["are",99.58,99.74],["valid",99.74,100.1],["observations,",100.1,100.82],["but",101.46,101.8],["you",101.8,102.1],["should",102.1,102.34],["word",102.34,102.66],["them",102.66,102.82],["in",102.82,102.96],["such",102.96,103.2],["a",103.2,103.36],["way",103.36,103.56],["that",103.56,103.76],["they",103.76,103.92],["won't",103.92,104.16]]},{"start":104.16,"end":107.26,"text":"cause offence. Any advice should be constructive.","words":[["cause",104.16,104.38],["offence.",104.38,104.9],["Any",105.48,105.68],["advice",105.68,106.08],["should",106.08,106.4],["be",106.4,106.58],["constructive.",106.58,107.26]]},{"start":107.92,"end":114.42,"text":"Yeah, it's a really interesting module and I think work placements like these are particularly","words":[["Yeah,",107.92,108.32],["it's",108.8,109.22],["a",109.22,109.34],["really",109.34,109.56],["interesting",109.56,110.16],["module",110.16,110.72],["and",110.72,111.2],["I",111.2,111.76],["think",111.76,111.98],["work",111.98,112.34],["placements",112.34,112.98],["like",112.98,113.24],["these",113.24,113.64],["are",113.64,113.92],["particularly",113.92,114.42]]},{"start":114.42,"end":116.48,"text":"valuable on a course like tourism.","words":[["valuable",114.42,115.1],["on",115.1,115.4],["a",115.4,115.54],["course",115.54,115.78],["like",115.78,116.0],["tourism.",116.0,116.48]]},{"start":117.48,"end":121.86,"text":"It boosts your confidence to think that the management is interested in what a student","words":[["It",117.48,117.74],["boosts",117.74,118.34],["your",118.34,118.44],["confidence",118.44,118.92],["to",118.92,119.3],["think",119.3,119.54],["that",119.54,119.76],["the",119.76,119.86],["management",119.86,120.26],["is",120.26,120.58],["interested",120.58,121.04],["in",121.04,121.28],["what",121.28,121.44],["a",121.44,121.58],["student",121.58,121.86]]},{"start":121.86,"end":122.54,"text":"has to say.","words":[["has",121.86,122.1],["to",122.1,122.26],["say.",122.26,122.54]]},{"start":122.54,"end":129.14,"text":"Absolutely. Though I worry slightly that we're making business judgements based on so little","words":[["Absolutely.",122.54,123.4],["Though",124.26,124.64],["I",124.64,125.1],["worry",125.1,125.38],["slightly",125.38,125.78],["that",125.78,126.2],["we're",126.2,126.6],["making",126.6,126.86],["business",126.86,127.28],["judgements",127.28,127.88],["based",127.88,128.2],["on",128.2,128.56],["so",128.56,128.92],["little",128.92,129.14]]},{"start":129.14,"end":133.62,"text":"experience. Companies might think we know more than we actually do.","words":[["experience.",129.14,129.94],["Companies",130.74,131.16],["might",131.16,131.54],["think",131.54,131.8],["we",131.8,132.06],["know",132.06,132.24],["more",132.24,132.56],["than",132.56,132.7],["we",132.7,132.82],["actually",132.82,133.16],["do.",133.16,133.62]]},{"start":133.94,"end":138.46,"text":"I think you've got a point there. But don't get me wrong, taken as a whole, it's been","words":[["I",133.94,134.1],["think",134.1,134.2],["you've",134.2,134.38],["got",134.38,134.48],["a",134.48,134.58],["point",134.58,134.78],["there.",134.78,135.08],["But",135.42,135.68],["don't",135.68,135.82],["get",135.82,135.96],["me",135.96,136.08],["wrong,",136.08,136.38],["taken",136.8,137.12],["as",137.12,137.32],["a",137.32,137.4],["whole,",137.4,137.74],["it's",138.16,138.28],["been",138.28,138.46]]},{"start":138.46,"end":143.56,"text":"a great module. And I think it's good to include such practical study alongside the","words":[["a",138.46,138.6],["great",138.6,138.74],["module.",138.74,139.18],["And",139.66,139.84],["I",139.84,139.98],["think",139.98,140.14],["it's",140.14,140.42],["good",140.42,140.6],["to",140.6,140.78],["include",140.78,141.2],["such",141.2,141.52],["practical",141.52,142.08],["study",142.08,142.58],["alongside",142.58,143.08],["the",143.08,143.56]]},{"start":143.56,"end":146.22,"text":"more traditional, academically oriented ones.","words":[["more",143.56,143.74],["traditional,",143.74,144.26],["academically",144.6,145.18],["oriented",145.18,145.8],["ones.",145.8,146.22]]},{"start":146.56,"end":148.12,"text":"It's been completely absorbing.","words":[["It's",146.56,146.78],["been",146.78,146.92],["completely",146.92,147.4],["absorbing.",147.4,148.12]]},{"start":148.12,"end":154.08,"text":"Which sometimes means we haven't devoted enough time to other parts of the course. You know?","words":[["Which",148.12,149.3],["sometimes",149.3,149.78],["means",149.78,150.22],["we",150.22,150.52],["haven't",150.52,150.84],["devoted",150.84,151.12],["enough",151.12,151.5],["time",151.5,151.86],["to",151.86,152.1],["other",152.1,152.3],["parts",152.3,152.6],["of",152.6,152.72],["the",152.72,152.8],["course.",152.8,153.02],["You",153.72,153.96],["know?",153.96,154.08]]},{"start":154.36,"end":154.74,"text":"Yeah.","words":[["Yeah.",154.36,154.74]]},{"start":158.21,"end":164.65,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the discussion, you have some time to look at questions 25 to 30.","words":[["Before",158.21,158.65],["you",158.65,158.91],["hear",158.91,159.19],["the",159.19,159.41],["rest",159.41,159.67],["of",159.67,159.79],["the",159.79,159.85],["discussion,",159.85,160.25],["you",160.93,161.17],["have",161.17,161.41],["some",161.41,161.61],["time",161.61,162.07],["to",162.07,162.37],["look",162.37,162.49],["at",162.49,162.63],["questions",162.63,163.05],["25",163.05,164.03],["to",164.03,164.27],["30.",164.27,164.65]]},{"start":195.3,"end":198.96,"text":"Now listen and answer questions 25 to 30.","words":[["Now",195.3,195.58],["listen",195.58,195.88],["and",195.88,196.32],["answer",196.32,196.78],["questions",196.78,197.24],["25",197.24,198.24],["to",198.24,198.58],["30.",198.58,198.96]]},{"start":202.56,"end":205.38,"text":"How are you getting on with your preparation for the presentation?","words":[["How",202.56,202.8],["are",202.8,202.92],["you",202.92,202.98],["getting",202.98,203.18],["on",203.18,203.4],["with",203.4,203.56],["your",203.56,203.74],["preparation",203.74,204.38],["for",204.38,204.68],["the",204.68,204.78],["presentation?",204.78,205.38]]},{"start":206.2,"end":210.84,"text":"Not too bad, but we'd like to talk over some of our plans with you.","words":[["Not",206.2,206.6],["too",206.6,206.96],["bad,",206.96,207.38],["but",207.66,207.98],["we'd",207.98,208.42],["like",208.42,208.56],["to",208.56,208.74],["talk",208.74,209.02],["over",209.02,209.38],["some",209.38,209.68],["of",209.68,209.86],["our",209.86,209.98],["plans",209.98,210.34],["with",210.34,210.62],["you.",210.62,210.84]]},{"start":211.24,"end":211.58,"text":"Fine.","words":[["Fine.",211.24,211.58]]},{"start":211.58,"end":217.02,"text":"We've got several sections. We're going to start with historical development of","words":[["We've",211.58,212.4],["got",212.4,212.56],["several",212.56,212.98],["sections.",212.98,213.44],["We're",214.5,214.7],["going",214.7,214.84],["to",214.84,215.0],["start",215.0,215.26],["with",215.26,215.52],["historical",215.52,216.02],["development",216.02,216.66],["of",216.66,217.02]]},{"start":217.02,"end":223.44,"text":"the visitor attraction. How it started as a very small zoo and grew, especially in","words":[["the",217.02,217.16],["visitor",217.16,217.48],["attraction.",217.48,218.06],["How",218.8,219.22],["it",219.22,219.42],["started",219.42,219.92],["as",219.92,220.16],["a",220.16,220.28],["very",220.28,220.5],["small",220.5,220.88],["zoo",220.88,221.28],["and",221.28,221.84],["grew,",221.84,222.22],["especially",222.72,223.08],["in",223.08,223.44]]},{"start":223.44,"end":229.48,"text":"the 1990s. We've got some great pictures of the way it looked in 1970. Lovely, but","words":[["the",223.44,223.52],["1990s.",223.52,224.58],["We've",225.08,225.3],["got",225.3,225.38],["some",225.38,225.54],["great",225.54,225.78],["pictures",225.78,226.2],["of",226.2,226.48],["the",226.48,226.58],["way",226.58,226.7],["it",226.7,226.82],["looked",226.82,226.96],["in",226.96,227.16],["1970.",227.16,227.74],["Lovely,",228.2,228.6],["but",229.28,229.48]]},{"start":229.48,"end":233.48,"text":"remember the emphasis of the presentation as a whole should be on the","words":[["remember",229.48,229.84],["the",229.84,230.12],["emphasis",230.12,230.62],["of",230.62,231.06],["the",231.06,231.18],["presentation",231.18,231.78],["as",231.78,232.06],["a",232.06,232.18],["whole",232.18,232.58],["should",232.58,233.04],["be",233.04,233.22],["on",233.22,233.36],["the",233.36,233.48]]},{"start":233.48,"end":240.08,"text":"present. And the future. Perhaps we should shorten this? I think we should. Yep.","words":[["present.",233.48,233.9],["And",234.4,234.7],["the",234.7,234.9],["future.",234.9,235.3],["Perhaps",236.14,236.54],["we",236.54,236.84],["should",236.84,237.14],["shorten",237.14,237.64],["this?",237.64,238.0],["I",238.4,238.54],["think",238.54,238.68],["we",238.68,238.86],["should.",238.86,239.08],["Yep.",239.72,240.08]]},{"start":240.08,"end":243.2,"text":"We want to explain the management organisation.","words":[["We",240.08,240.76],["want",240.76,240.94],["to",240.94,241.1],["explain",241.1,241.54],["the",241.54,241.8],["management",241.8,242.24],["organisation.",242.24,243.2]]},{"start":243.9,"end":247.98,"text":"I'm worried this section is going to be so long and boring for the audience.","words":[["I'm",243.9,244.28],["worried",244.28,244.56],["this",244.56,244.9],["section",244.9,245.26],["is",245.26,245.46],["going",245.46,245.58],["to",245.58,245.7],["be",245.7,245.82],["so",245.82,246.04],["long",246.04,246.4],["and",246.4,246.58],["boring",246.58,247.04],["for",247.04,247.32],["the",247.32,247.46],["audience.",247.46,247.98]]},{"start":248.5,"end":254.8,"text":"Well, it'd be more interesting if you have a slide with a graphic showing the organisational structure.","words":[["Well,",248.5,248.88],["it'd",249.18,249.38],["be",249.38,249.54],["more",249.54,249.82],["interesting",249.82,250.4],["if",250.4,250.7],["you",250.7,250.88],["have",250.88,251.08],["a",251.08,251.2],["slide",251.2,251.82],["with",251.82,252.14],["a",252.14,252.28],["graphic",252.28,252.66],["showing",252.66,253.12],["the",253.12,253.36],["organisational",253.36,254.24],["structure.",254.24,254.8]]},{"start":255.46,"end":258.72,"text":"It won't seem so long if the audience have something to look at.","words":[["It",255.46,255.76],["won't",255.76,256.02],["seem",256.02,256.22],["so",256.22,256.48],["long",256.48,256.74],["if",256.74,256.94],["the",256.94,257.08],["audience",257.08,257.4],["have",257.4,257.68],["something",257.68,257.98],["to",257.98,258.18],["look",258.18,258.36],["at.",258.36,258.72]]},{"start":259.18,"end":262.96,"text":"That's easy, because I got a hold of a copy of one from the zoo last week.","words":[["That's",259.18,259.54],["easy,",259.54,259.84],["because",259.98,260.32],["I",260.32,260.52],["got",260.52,260.68],["a",260.68,260.82],["hold",260.82,260.94],["of",260.94,261.1],["a",261.1,261.16],["copy",261.16,261.46],["of",261.46,261.64],["one",261.64,261.84],["from",261.84,262.04],["the",262.04,262.22],["zoo",262.22,262.4],["last",262.4,262.64],["week.",262.64,262.96]]},{"start":263.36,"end":263.9,"text":"Well done!","words":[["Well",263.36,263.6],["done!",263.6,263.9]]},{"start":263.9,"end":269.3,"text":"for the section on finances we've only got basic information and I wondered","words":[["for",263.9,264.84],["the",264.84,264.94],["section",264.94,265.24],["on",265.24,265.44],["finances",265.44,266.06],["we've",266.06,266.82],["only",266.82,266.96],["got",266.96,267.14],["basic",267.14,267.54],["information",267.54,268.04],["and",268.04,268.92],["I",268.92,269.06],["wondered",269.06,269.3]]},{"start":269.3,"end":273.88,"text":"whether we need to interview the accounts director she's very helpful to be","words":[["whether",269.3,269.56],["we",269.56,269.74],["need",269.74,269.9],["to",269.9,270.1],["interview",270.1,270.44],["the",270.44,270.66],["accounts",270.66,271.0],["director",271.0,271.58],["she's",271.58,272.26],["very",272.26,272.46],["helpful",272.46,272.98],["to",272.98,273.72],["be",273.72,273.88]]},{"start":273.88,"end":278.96,"text":"honest I'd aim to keep this part to the minimum it's not a major focus of the","words":[["honest",273.88,274.1],["I'd",274.1,274.78],["aim",274.78,274.96],["to",274.96,275.12],["keep",275.12,275.3],["this",275.3,275.58],["part",275.58,275.9],["to",275.9,276.08],["the",276.08,276.18],["minimum",276.18,276.52],["it's",276.52,277.42],["not",277.42,277.54],["a",277.54,277.7],["major",277.7,278.06],["focus",278.06,278.52],["of",278.52,278.84],["the",278.84,278.96]]},{"start":278.96,"end":285.0,"text":"module are you sure I'm happy to talk to her let's not use up time we could","words":[["module",278.96,279.32],["are",279.32,280.12],["you",280.12,280.28],["sure",280.28,280.76],["I'm",280.76,281.82],["happy",281.82,282.04],["to",282.04,282.24],["talk",282.24,282.46],["to",282.46,282.66],["her",282.66,282.94],["let's",282.94,283.76],["not",283.76,283.92],["use",283.92,284.2],["up",284.2,284.4],["time",284.4,284.66],["we",284.66,284.84],["could",284.84,285.0]]},{"start":285.0,"end":290.14,"text":"spend on more useful things okay we'll go with what we've got then now","words":[["spend",285.0,285.24],["on",285.24,285.48],["more",285.48,285.68],["useful",285.68,286.0],["things",286.0,286.4],["okay",286.4,287.28],["we'll",287.28,288.2],["go",288.2,288.34],["with",288.34,288.58],["what",288.58,288.76],["we've",288.76,288.94],["got",288.94,289.08],["then",289.08,289.4],["now",2