311.04,"end":316.06,"text":"And then we've got a section called Key Problems. We're not altogether happy with","words":[["And",311.04,311.32],["then",311.32,311.46],["we've",311.46,311.74],["got",311.74,311.84],["a",311.84,311.94],["section",311.94,312.3],["called",312.3,312.76],["Key",312.76,313.16],["Problems.",313.16,313.84],["We're",314.32,314.84],["not",314.84,314.96],["altogether",314.96,315.42],["happy",315.42,315.86],["with",315.86,316.06]]},{"start":316.06,"end":319.18,"text":"the name. I was wondering about key challenges.","words":[["the",316.06,316.16],["name.",316.16,316.46],["I",317.02,317.32],["was",317.32,317.48],["wondering",317.48,317.8],["about",317.8,318.18],["key",318.18,318.68],["challenges.",318.68,319.18]]},{"start":319.18,"end":323.48,"text":"I think that automatically gives it a more positive perspective.","words":[["I",319.18,320.14],["think",320.14,320.54],["that",320.54,320.84],["automatically",320.84,321.5],["gives",321.5,321.92],["it",321.92,322.1],["a",322.1,322.2],["more",322.2,322.36],["positive",322.36,322.88],["perspective.",322.88,323.48]]},{"start":324.32,"end":325.0,"text":"Okay then.","words":[["Okay",324.32,324.72],["then.",324.72,325.0]]},{"start":326.1,"end":329.22,"text":"And the concluding part is further research needed.","words":[["And",326.1,326.38],["the",326.38,326.56],["concluding",326.56,327.04],["part",327.04,327.26],["is",327.26,327.68],["further",327.68,328.22],["research",328.22,328.76],["needed.",328.76,329.22]]},{"start":330.08,"end":334.02,"text":"We're planning to mention one other tourist attraction, a local theme park.","words":[["We're",330.08,330.3],["planning",330.3,330.48],["to",330.48,330.7],["mention",330.7,330.96],["one",330.96,331.34],["other",331.34,331.68],["tourist",331.68,331.94],["attraction,",331.94,332.4],["a",333.14,333.2],["local",333.2,333.44],["theme",333.44,333.7],["park.",333.7,334.02]]},{"start":334.44,"end":335.42,"text":"Will that be enough?","words":[["Will",334.44,334.7],["that",334.7,334.94],["be",334.94,335.16],["enough?",335.16,335.42]]},{"start":336.32,"end":338.66,"text":"Maybe two different attractions then?","words":[["Maybe",336.32,336.8],["two",336.8,337.42],["different",337.42,337.76],["attractions",337.76,338.28],["then?",338.28,338.66]]},{"start":338.96,"end":339.28,"text":"Okay.","words":[["Okay.",338.96,339.28]]},{"start":339.88,"end":342.64,"text":"Okay. Well, why don't you get back to me?","words":[["Okay.",339.88,340.42],["Well,",341.02,341.4],["why",341.48,341.62],["don't",341.62,341.82],["you",341.82,341.92],["get",341.92,342.06],["back",342.06,342.26],["to",342.26,342.48],["me?",342.48,342.64]]}]}